  "description": "Chinese holiday and adjusted-workday identification library with built-in annual holiday data and lunar festival support. Works fully offline and supports .NET Framework 4.5, .NET Standard 2.0/2.1 and modern .NET. 中国节假日与调休识别库，内置年度假期数据并支持农历节日判定，完全离线运行。",
  "iconFile": "leaf.png",
